# @domain: policies
# #5020 — one violation of domain-has-owner: the Domain row of x names no owner (y does).
@prefix c: <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#> .
<urn:chorus:domains:domains> { c:x a c:Domain ; c:instancesGraph "urn:chorus:domains:x" .
                               c:y a c:Domain ; c:instancesGraph "urn:chorus:domains:y" ; c:ownedBy c:principal-wren . }
